WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.633
Install: npm i -D @morsadev/sdlc, then npx sdlc init. sdlc doctor checks the setup.

00:00:33.633 --> 00:01:06.033
A small change takes the quick lane: no spec or plan, limits checked on every push.

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:57.400
A real feature: the agent writes intent, spec and plan; you approve each one. Agent steps are sped up.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:17.067
Code pushed before the plan is approved is blocked by the git hook.

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:31.667
The same decisions in the local dashboard: npx sdlc ui.

